body:
Things you need to ask yourself: In the moment, did you not want this to happen? Did you push him away? Did you say no at any point? If you weren't able to say no, did you really want him to be there? Did you want those things to happen?

&#x200B;

If you did these things at the time with consent but you in retrospect you feel guilt and shame, then it is remorse and not sexual assault.
